      "text": "The driver contains the source portion of [SQLx #4334](https://github.com/transact-rs/sqlx/commit/2cd6369be3ca1f69cd68ac71ff466486d8e3040a). It exposes `MySqlConnectOptions::found_rows` with the upstream default. OpenRust opts out for its own MySQL and MariaDB connections to use Laravel's affected-row semantics. The remaining SQLx crates still resolve from the locked registry versions."
